<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Zach's personal website — projects, ideas, and a little about me.">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
  <title>Zach | Personal Website</title>
  <style>
    :root { --ink:#182725; --muted:#53645f; --paper:#f7f8f2; --accent:#265c48; --line:#d8e0d4; }
    * { box-sizing:border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior:smooth; }
    body { margin:0; background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; line-height:1.65; }
    a { color:inherit; text-underline-offset:5px; }
    a:focus-visible { outline:3px solid var(--accent); outline-offset:6px; }
    .wrap { width:min(1080px,90%); margin:auto; }
    .skip { position:absolute; top:-80px; padding:12px; background:white; }
    .skip:focus { top:8px; }
    header { border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
    nav { min-height:90px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:24px; }
    .brand { font-size:24px; font-weight:800; text-decoration:none; letter-spacing:-1px; }
    .brand span { color:var(--accent); }
    .links { display:flex; gap:28px; font-size:14px; }
    .links a { text-decoration:none; }
    .links a:hover { text-decoration:underline; }
    .hero { padding:100px 0 92px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.6fr 1fr; align-items:center; gap:60px; }
    .eyebrow { font-size:12px; letter-spacing:2px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; }
    h1 { font-size:clamp(48px,7vw,86px); line-height:1.05; letter-spacing:-4px; margin:20px 0 28px; }
    h2 { font-size:32px; line-height:1.2; letter-spacing:-1px; margin:0 0 22px; }
    h3 { font-size:21px; margin:14px 0 10px; }
    p { color:var(--muted); }
    .intro { max-width:510px; font-size:19px; }
    .button { display:inline-block; margin-top:20px; background:var(--accent); color:white; padding:13px 23px; border-radius:6px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700; font-size:14px; }
    .button:hover { background:#183e30; }
    .art { aspect-ratio:1; border-radius:50%; background:#e5ebdd; position:relative; display:grid; place-items:center; overflow:hidden; }
    .art::before { content:""; width:70%; height:70%; border:1px solid #aec2ac; position:absolute; border-radius:50%; }
    .art::after { content:""; width:93%; height:93%; border:1px solid #c5d3be; position:absolute; border-radius:50%; }
    .art span { font-size:clamp(60px,9vw,110px); font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-7px; color:var(--accent); transform:rotate(-8deg); }
    section { padding:64px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); scroll-margin-top:24px; }
    .section-head { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:20px; }
    .cards { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px; margin-top:20px; }
    .card { padding:28px; background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; }
    .number { font-family:monospace; font-size:13px; color:var(--accent); }
    .card p { margin-bottom:0; font-size:15px; }
    .about { max-width:720px; font-size:18px; }
    .contact { background:#e9eee3; padding:32px; border-radius:10px; }
    footer { padding:30px 0; font-size:13px; color:var(--muted); display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:20px; }
    @media(max-width:700px) { nav { min-height:76px; } .links { gap:16px; } .hero { grid-template-columns:1fr; padding:64px 0; gap:35px; } h1 { letter-spacing:-2px; } .art { width:210px; justify-self:center; } .cards { grid-template-columns:1fr; } section { padding:45px 0; } .section-head { display:block; } footer { flex-direction:column; gap:5px; } }
    @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { html { scroll-behavior:auto; } }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
  <header>
    <nav class="wrap" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a class="brand" href="#">Zach<span>.</span></a>
      <div class="links"><a href="#projects">Projects</a><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></div>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main id="main" class="wrap">
    <div class="hero">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">My corner of the internet</div>
        <h1>Hi, I'm Zach.<br>Welcome in.</h1>
        <p class="intro">A place for my projects, ideas, and things I'm learning along the way.</p>
        <a class="button" href="#projects">Explore my projects &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="art" aria-hidden="true"><span>Z.</span></div>
    </div>
    <section id="projects" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
      <div class="section-head"><h2 id="projects-title">Selected projects</h2><span class="eyebrow">A work in progress</span></div>
      <!-- Replace these starter cards with your project names, descriptions, and links. -->
      <div class="cards">
        <article class="card"><span class="number">01 / PROJECT</span><h3>My first project</h3><p>Add a description of something you built, researched, or created. Explain what it does and what you learned.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="number">02 / PROJECT</span><h3>Something I'm learning</h3><p>Share a class project, a new skill, or an experiment you're working on.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="number">03 / PROJECT</span><h3>What's next</h3><p>Use this space for your next idea. Every great project starts somewhere.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
      <div class="eyebrow">A little introduction</div>
      <h2 id="about-title">About me</h2>
      <!-- Customize this paragraph with your background and interests. -->
      <p class="about">I'm Zach, and this is my personal website. I'll use this space to share my work, document what I'm learning, and explore new ideas. Thanks for stopping by!</p>
    </section>
    <section id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
      <div class="contact"><div class="eyebrow">Let's connect</div><h2 id="contact-title">Get in touch</h2>
        <!-- Replace this text with your email address or GitHub profile link. -->
        <p>Add your email address or a link to your GitHub profile here so visitors can reach you.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="wrap"><span>&copy; 2026 Zach. Built with curiosity.</span><a href="#">Back to top &uarr;</a></footer>
</body>
</html>
